		<article class="message-body js-selectToQuote">
			
				
			

			<div >
				
					<div class="bbWrapper"><b>Kim Mohan</b>, known for work at TSR and Wizards of the Coast, editor-in-chief of <i>Dragon Magazine</i>, author of the AD&amp;D 1E <i>Wilderness Survival Guide</i>, and much more, passed away yesterday aged 73.<br />
<br />
Kim joined TSR in 1979, and became editor-in-chief of <i>Dragon Magazine</i> in 1989. He joined Gary Gygax's New Infinity Productions in 1986, but later returned to D&amp;D, working on D&amp;D 3E at WotC. He retired in 2013.<br />
<br />
Industry veterans have been paying tribute to Kim on social media and elsewhere.<br />
<br />
