		<article class="message-body js-selectToQuote">
			
				
			

			<div itemprop="text">
				
					<div class="bbWrapper">He was a legend, his work runs through the collection of every gamer that’s bought a sourcebook in the past several decades. Shame on those tossers that tried to lay Wizards’ missteps at his feet. Rest in Gold Pieces.</div>
				
			</div>

